	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030150"},
		line=1146,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"August 13th─",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Today, my father Warren is set to leave the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"A grand ceremony is being held in the courtyard of the Government-General to commemorate his departure.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Salute!”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"The soldiers lining both sides of the red carpet snap off a salute in perfect unison.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"My father unhurriedly saunters down the plush carpet.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Once he arrives at the end, an open limousine door is waiting to greet him.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Among those gathered to see the governor-general off are not just Republican soldiers and officers.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Empress Hisui and Okonogi are present as well.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Okonogi's speech, making Warren's temporary departure out to be some dramatic final farewell, is so unctuous that it makes me want to hurl.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Does he feel threatened now that his master isn't around anymore?",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"His instincts must be sharper than I gave him credit for...",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“At ease.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Good day, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your car awaits you.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"My father ducks his large frame into the limousine and settles into his seat.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"He casts his gaze out at me through the open window.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I heard you located the Sworn Blades headquarters.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Where might you have received that information?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“That's not of any concern to you.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"My father impassively peers into my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I appoint you acting governor-general in my absence.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“You'll have full authority over the Republican Army.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Sir.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"I snap off a salute.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Consider it a trial run for when you hopefully take over as governor-general.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Don't stir up any trouble while I'm away.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Affirmative. I shall live up to your expectations.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Seems like Rochel was actually telling the truth that one time.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"In the end, the status from riding on my father's coattails is all my life has ever amounted to.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Get moving.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"The car carrying my father rapidly recedes into the distance.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Only when it completely disappears from view does the tension in the surrounding air finally dissipate.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"The long-suffering soldiers, standing at attention this entire time, swiftly break formation and resume their typical duties.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...Rochel!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Your car awaits you, ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Rochel opens the car door with a polite bow.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Forget about the damn car...”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You leaked the intel about the Sworn Blades HQ, didn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I'm afraid I don't know what you're talking about.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How'd you hear about it?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Does it really matter? Your father thought highly of your efforts, did he not?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I said, how the ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"hell",
{"/font"},
" did you hear about it?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Rochel casually shrugs his shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I take pride in having friends in lots of places.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“And for the record, I've done absolutely nothing in violation of military law.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You son of a bitch...”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"My venomous glare doesn't faze him in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"None of my subordinates would ever leak such critical intel.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"I'd bet my life on that.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Which means Rochel must have somehow pulled a few strings.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I am currently making preparations to attack the Sworn Blades headquarters.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“His Excellency has issued orders that the entirety of Yogarasu District is to be reduced to ash.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What are you thinking?! Do you have any idea how many civilians are living there?!”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“The only way to successfully neutralize the warriors is through such a shock and awe attack.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Trying to root them out one by one will only lead to further casualties.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Yogarasu District is a veritable matchbox of wood and timber.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"As soon as the first bombs fall, it'll be turned into a sea of fire.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"We don't have a precise count of Yogarasu District's population, but it's said to easily number over five thousand.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Depending on the time of day, countless buyers and sellers might also be present.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"And it's these innocent civilians who will bear the brunt of the suffering.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It is unconscionable to harm innocent civilians.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Innocent civilians? Why, they're nothing but a pack of criminals.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...What?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“All manner of contraband wares are sold openly in Yogarasu District.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“In the interest of preserving public order in Tenkyo, it needs to be cleaned up sooner or later.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“This is preposterous.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Under my authority, I hereby rescind the bombing order.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“It came from the governor-general himself.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That same governor-general just delegated full authority over the Republican Army to me.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Rochel lets out a heavy sigh.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“You won't get many more opportunities like this one to stack up your accomplishments.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do you think nothing of killing innocent civilians?!”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Have you forgotten that we're an invading force?”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“It's rather late to be waving around your sense of justice at this stage.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“If you really want to play at being a saint, why not withdraw from the Empire right this very second?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Kh!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Without even realizing it, I grab Rochel by the collar.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“You've certainly developed an impressive bleeding heart as of late.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Whatever might've inspired this change, I wonder...”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"He flashes me the unperturbed smile worn only by those of distinguished breeding.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"But it belies his downright contemptible intentions.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"He's trying to call my relationship with Soujin into question.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You must be asking to get court-martialed for insubordination against a superior officer.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"I unceremoniously shove him away, and he crumples disgracefully on his rear end.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Hahaha, why, that would be a problem. I have subordinates to worry about, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Rochel stands up and dusts off his backside, as composed as ever.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“If, hypothetically speaking of course, you genuinely think that you can reach an understanding with the warriors, I believe you're gravely mistaken.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“We're the ones responsible for murdering their family and friends.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Even down to the last, they would never possibly forgive us.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“That's why we have to exterminate every last one of them.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"My heart creaks within the hollow of my chest.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Rochel is completely right... We ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"are",
{"/font"},
" the invaders.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"The invaders who killed the warriors' families.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"The unforgivable murderers who killed Tokita-kun's family.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"It should have been clear as day, yet somehow, I managed to delude myself this whole time.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Was it those halcyon days I spent alongside everyone in the student council office that made me go so soft?",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"No, that's not it...",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"I don't know when, but at some point, I found myself irrepressibly attracted to Tokita-kun.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"To his unwavering, resolute way of life. To the way he manages to always face forward without any hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"But precisely because Tokita-kun is the way he is, he'll never forgive us for what we've done.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"I have absolutely no doubt in my mind that even down to the last, he will hold fast to his convictions and keep up his fight.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Somewhere within the hollow of my chest, something very precious shatters to pieces.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In any case, you are not to proceed with the bombing. Stand by for further instructions.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That is a direct order.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Yes, ma'am. If you say so.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Rochel gives another shrug of his shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What other business do you have with me?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Why, you were the one who approached me.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Forget it then.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"I wordlessly shoo him away with the barest flick of my chin.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"It feels like all the air around me has been polluted by his presence.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(That bastard...)”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"At the very least, though, I managed to avert the bombing.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Even if we are invaders and they are our enemy, they deserve at least this modicum of respect.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Now I should be able to move forward with exterminating the warriors without any reservations.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Unbidden, the sight of Tokita-kun's face floats up within my mind's eye.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Please, that's enough already.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"I've already made up my mind...",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"...To forget all about you, Tokita-kun.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"The day before the uprising, the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"All the architects of Operation Bellflower are gathered here to hold our final meeting.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Tomorrow at nineteen hundred hours, the Sworn Blades will set forth from our headquarters and march on the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Our forces will clear a path without engaging.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“All you'll have to worry about is taking out Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And after we complete our objective?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Our side will call for a ceasefire. Your Majesty, please accept it right away.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I understand.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, I will be unable to leave the Imperial Palace. I shall be praying for everyone's safety.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Shino, are we all set for the broadcast?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I smuggled the whole setup into the palace disguised as provisions for the Republican Army.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“We'll be able to hear Her Majesty loud and clear.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We of the priesthood stand ready to offer our support to the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Elsa nods in satisfaction.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Though the meeting is proceeding without a hitch, we have our own designs in mind.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"To start with, we've relocated our muster point to safeguard against being ambushed.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"After we take down Okonogi, we've also made arrangements to flee to Iseya alongside Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Of course, Kanami and Kotone are already in on the plan.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Starting tomorrow, a new age will dawn on the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Our student council will be in the thick of things, so let's get our heads in the game.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“To the success of our uprising!”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"All of us raise our teacups at Elsa's toast.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Operation Bellflower has been in the works for the better part of a month.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"And tomorrow, it will all come to an end.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"After our meeting, Elsa calls out to me.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun, can I have some of your time?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sure thing.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Feeling everyone else's gaze on us, I follow Elsa out of the room.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"We arrive at an empty classroom where we can be alone.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tomorrow's the big day.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. Are all the preparations complete on your end?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We're all set. What about you?”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're ready to go, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You seem awfully calm, given the circumstances.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Is it because you live your life ready to leap into battle at any moment?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"I nod in reply.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"For one who stands ready to serve at any moment, a day such as today shouldn't be anything special.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Seems like you really understand how we warriors think now.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm, umm, glad you think so.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Elsa murmurs a bashful reply, twirling her beautiful hair around her finger.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do you remember what you once told me?”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“'I have faith that you will eventually find an object worthy of your fealty.'”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“'I look forward to seeing what you devote your fealty to.'”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I haven't stopped thinking about it ever since.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And just the other day, I think I finally found my answer.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Elsa shows me a rare expression.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"It's a serene and tranquil smile, one that betrays no signs of pretext.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm going to devote my fealty to the last and final modicum of virtue left within me.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You could say that the fealty demanded of a soldier is to loyally serve their country, but to me, that's never been what matters most.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I remember you said that you fight for those who suffer under tyranny.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's just a means to an end. It's not my ultimate goal.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Elsa declares, meeting my gaze head-on.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Those ultramarine eyes no longer contain even a glimmer of hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm very grateful to have met you, Tokita-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You helped me discover a part of myself even I didn't know I had.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Elsa offers me an outstretched hand.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If I've been able to help you, I'm glad to hear it.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"I clasp her hand in my own.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The next time we meet will be in the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Come tomorrow, one of us will be brought to heel before the other.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Whether Elsa betrays us first or we betray her, our impending confrontation is already set in stone.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"It's very possible that I might even have to cut her down with my own two hands.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"But although it must come to pass, I cannot help but feel a twinge of sorrow in my chest.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"By no means would I say that I dislike Elsa on a personal level.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"In another life, I surely would have found her boldly daring yet playfully mischievous personality irresistibly attractive.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you'd like, we could exchange contact details.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Heheh, after all this time?”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But sure thing. I don't see why not.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Elsa and I point our cell phones at each other.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Not the address book. The call function.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, I see. I'm not the best with technology.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm? It says the call was dropped.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh? How strange...”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"After some awkward fumbling, we eventually manage to exchange phone numbers.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ehehee.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If anything comes up, just give me a call.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Let's pray that I won't have to.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"We finish the rest of our classes and start heading home as usual.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Tokita-sama, Miyaguni-sama, might I have a moment of your time?”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, sure you want a third wheel like me butting in?”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't be like that now.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Shut it, ex-retainer.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“This is a matter which greatly concerns you, Miyaguni-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"Kanami insists with a serious expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"It must really be important.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I understand.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Kanami's melancholic gaze lingers on the twilight-dappled classroom for some time before she breaks her silence.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I believe that today will be the last day I find myself here at school.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Thank you very much for serving as my escort all this time.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Our time together has become a precious memory I shall not soon forget.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"Kanami offers us a deep bow.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-sama, I return Onii-sama to you.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Really? You're all done with him?”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The agreement was that I'd serve you until the situation settled down.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Kanami serenely shakes her head.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I have caused the two of you a great deal of trouble already.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“All I wished was to indulge my selfishness and have Onii-sama fret over me a little.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"Regardless of whether she aligns herself with us or Elsa, Kanami has no happy ending in store for her.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"She has already resolved herself to seek atonement for all her trespasses.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"And so, she made her final request simply hoping to spend just a little time with me in the twilight of her days.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama, you are still a warrior, are you not?”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It should be unthinkable for you to continue serving a false Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Tomorrow is the day that will decide the fate of this Empire. Please, offer the full measure of your devotion serving at Miyaguni-sama's side.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am a proud daughter of House Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If I were to hold you back in this moment where the fate of the Empire rests on a blade's edge, I would never be able to face Mother and Father.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Sending the ones you love unto battle with a smile is the sacred duty of those who tend the hearth.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"For a few fleeting moments, the last rays of twilight lend their radiance to Kanami's smile.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"Until, just like the tears at the corners of her eyes, they too evanesce into nothingness.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I thank you for your gracious understanding.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Gosh, you could at least act a little disappointed, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Kanami turns toward Akari.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama is always like this.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Even when he was with me, you were the only thing on his mind.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“As soon as he spotted Elsa-sama accosting you, he threw me aside to rush to your aid.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Throwing aside your charge just like that? Some bodyguard you are...”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"Akari doesn't miss the chance to berate me, but the warmth in her eyes reveals her true feelings.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“When you spoke of the resolve needed to be Empress, I came to the realization that I am unworthy even to be an impostor.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“To have brushed against the profound grace of the Imperial Family's station was an honor I never once deserved.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I beseech your forgiveness for such impudence.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"Kanami bows before Akari as a vassal to a lord.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What are you even talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You did everything you could to keep up the people's faith. That's an irrefutable fact.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“For the past three years, you've done a splendid job as Empress while I sat by and did nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Make no mistake, impersonating the Empress is a grave sin.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"“But be that as it may,” Akari says, looking upon Kanami with a kindly smile.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've done more than enough to atone for your trespasses.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I forgive you for everything.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oomikami, too, will surely grant you His salvation.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, this guy might whine about it, but feel free to just ignore him.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Akari pokes me with her elbow.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But─”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No one wants to hear it.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I swear, you just looove going against your lord's every order, don't you?”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"Akari heaves a theatrical sigh, her hands on her hips.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Heh, guess you've got a good point.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If Her Imperial Highness grants her forgiveness, I have no objections.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You have my gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"I lower my head to Akari.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"Flustered, Kanami bows her head as well.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We'd better bring our A-game tomorrow so you two can live out your lives in peace.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes! I shall fulfill the task before me to the best of my ability.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"Akari nods in satisfaction.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“C'mon, let's go make our final preparations for tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your humble escort awaits, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Your",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Majesty.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
